  "title": "SIP5.2: Multi-Chain Set Non-Sweepable Tokens",
  "description": "# SIP5.2: Multi-Chain Set Non-Sweepable Tokens\n\n## Summary\nThis proposal sets non-sweepable tokens for arks across all active chains in the Lazy Summer Protocol ecosystem by calling setNonSweepableToken on the Raft contract.\n\n## Motivation\nCertain tokens (pools, vaults, or siUSDVault addresses) should be marked as non-sweepable for their respective arks to prevent accidental sweeping during protocol operations.\n\n## Specifications\n\n### Actions\nbase:\n\n- Set 0x000000000001CdB57E58Fa75Fe420a0f4D6640D5 as non-sweepable for ark gauntlet-usd-alpha (0x6B58aeeaDd96dbfEAcF90948e26d51C506213766)\n\n\narbitrum:\n\n- Set 0x7c574174DA4b2be3f705c6244B4BfA0815a8B3Ed as non-sweepable for ark morpho_gauntlet_usdc_prime (0xf617F06a1f2992Ee789B2bA69D1fE8DD49491D0c)\n\n- Set 0x7e97fa6893871A2751B5fE961978DCCb2c201E65 as non-sweepable for ark morpho_gauntlet_usdc_core (0xa2B387C36Bd67D69755a372F383087C82a96f1f1)\n\n- Set 0x87DEAE530841A9671326C9D5B9f91bdB11F3162c as non-sweepable for ark morpho_y_og_usdc (0x393e981A6b76A18CC5A0FB619C6a218D4E53B4B4)\n\n- Set 0x250CF7c82bAc7cB6cf899b6052979d4B5BA1f9ca as non-sweepable for ark morpho_steakhouse_prime_usdc (0x32B632D16710fA9dd121FD22052057F5A5e39CB7)\n\n- Set 0xa60643c90A542A95026C0F1dbdB0615fF42019Cf as non-sweepable for ark morpho_mev_capital_usdc (0xeaDBbFC3aD27a6CFE1e785598F4Ff6909DeC2D82)\n\n- Set 0x794a61358D6845594F94dc1DB02A252b5b4814aD as non-sweepable for ark USDC (0x7cC488F2681cFC2A5E8A00184bfA94ea6d520D1c)\n\n- Set 0x9c4ec768c28520B50860ea7a15bd7213a9fF58bf as non-sweepable for ark USDC (0xcA2e14c7C03C9961c296C89e2d2279F5F7DB15b4)\n\n- Set 0x1A996cb54bb95462040408C06122D45D6Cdb6096 as non-sweepable for ark USDC (0x0C939b702524fDaBa4914E905Bcb850182308141)\n\n- Set 0x890A69EF363C9c7BdD5E36eb95Ceb569F63ACbF6 as non-sweepable for ark USDC (0x4cEeE1b6289624d381383C1Bb42B118d5f2c3274)\n\n- Set 0x940098b108fB7D0a7E374f6eDED7760787464609 as non-sweepable for ark sUSDS (0xAf755eD8D76Fdceab2B1cdC0d4C8C94f4e8eEe54)\n\nmainnet:\n\n- Set 0x9396dcbf78fc526bb003665337c5e73b699571ef as non-sweepable for ark kpk-ETH (0xdF8b1E08679D6035b6c1504e04C5C9e72a0555Fe)\n\n- Set 0xe108fbc04852B5df72f9E44d7C29F47e7A993aDd as non-sweepable for ark morpho_kpk_usdc_prime (0xcA2e14c7C03C9961c296C89e2d2279F5F7DB15b4)\n\n- Set 0xd564F765F9aD3E7d2d6cA782100795a885e8e7C8 as non-sweepable for ark morpho_kpk_weth_prime (0x4cEeE1b6289624d381383C1Bb42B118d5f2c3274)\n\n- Set 0x87870Bca3F3fD6335C3F4ce8392D69350B4fA4E2 as non-sweepable for ark WETH (0xd33e132c34c978c18acd8cd90d14467c1bf10f30)\n\n- Set 0xA17581A9E3356d9A858b789D68B4d866e593aE94 as non-sweepable for ark WETH (0xc41af022a0cbbbd95b4a4eb5b9ebb51bb888bb0d)\n\n- Set 0xC13e21B648A5Ee794902342038FF3aDAB66BE987 as non-sweepable for ark WETH (0xa3B8e720cFff63fd47Ea80e18b773965E25c2b6c)\n\nsonic:\nNo arks configured (or all tokens already non-sweepable)\n\n## Technical Details\nThe proposal calls setNonSweepableToken on the Raft contract for each ark's associated pool/vault/siUSDVault address. This ensures these tokens cannot be swept during protocol operations.",
